{"id":"607643","name":"鸡蛋酱拌面","author":"乐焙儿","authorId":"10795907","desc":"","cover":"images/607643/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"青红椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取适量绿，红杭椒切段备用。","img":"images/607643/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱切丁备用。","img":"images/607643/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋磕入碗中打散备用。","img":"images/607643/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"所有调料倒入碗中，加入半碗水调匀备用。","img":"images/607643/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中倒入适量色拉油，倒入鸡蛋炒散，炒熟后盛出备用。","img":"images/607643/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中再加少许油，放入洋葱丁翻炒。","img":"images/607643/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入鸡蛋翻炒片刻。","img":"images/607643/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入杭椒翻炒片刻。","img":"images/607643/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入料汁翻炒均匀。","img":"images/607643/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅前撒上小葱花。","img":"images/607643/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅里加入适量水，烧开后下面条煮熟。","img":"images/607643/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"面条煮熟后捞到碗中。","img":"images/607643/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"浇上鸡蛋酱。","img":"images/607643/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀，开吃。","img":"images/607643/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}